---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import "../../styles/service.css";

const SITE = "https://www.tmdesignengineering.com";
const url = `${SITE}/services`;

const jsonld = [
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "CollectionPage",
    "@id": `${url}#page`,
    url,
    name: "Services",
    isPartOf: { "@id": `${SITE}/#website` },
    description:
      "Design engineering services for founders and startups: from a low-commitment Power Hour to feasibility, MVP development, verification, manufacturing preparation and full product development.",
  },
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    itemListElement: [
      { "@type": "ListItem", position: 1, name: "Home", item: `${SITE}/` },
      { "@type": "ListItem", position: 2, name: "Services", item: url },
    ],
  },
];
---
<Base
  title="Services, Design Engineering & Product Development | Thomas McKee"
  description="How I can help take a physical product from idea to production: entry offers, feasibility, concept and MVP, verification, manufacturing preparation, full product development and contract engineering."
  type="website"
  jsonld={jsonld}>
<main>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="svc-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">Services</span>
      <h1>How I can help, <em>and where to start</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">Your needs are not one size fits all. Start with a workshop to see if we're a good fit, use a single fixed-scope service when you know exactly what you need, or hire me to take you through the full product development journey. If you are not sure exactly what you need, book a free intro call to discuss your project and whether I can help.</p>
      <div class="svc-hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/#contact">Book a free intro call <span class="arw">→</span></a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#core">Fixed-scope services</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FRONT DOOR -->
  <section class="band alt">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="proof">
        <div class="pl">How I work</div>
        <p>Whether in a large full-project engagement or a shorter prototype development phase, I always scope a short phase initially so that we can work out whether we're a good fit to work together. From there, phases are scoped naturally, with clear timeframe, cost and deliverables quoted, and decision points throughout to ensure we're always going in the direction you want. I value clear, collaborative and transparent working, so I'm always happy to have a check-in call to let you know how things are going.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- START HERE -->
  <section class="band" id="start">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="sec-idx">Start here</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title">Get an engineer's eyes on your project</h2>
      <p class="sec-intro">Bring a question, a specific problem or a design and get experienced eyes on it. I'll go through it with you live, online or in person.</p>
      <div class="svcx-grid">
        <a class="svcx" href="/services/power-hour">
          <div class="svcx-top"><h3>Power Hour</h3><span class="svcx-price">from £50</span></div>
          <p>A focused hour on your specific problem or decision, with a short written follow-up. The simplest way to find out what working with me is like, or just to get unstuck on a project.</p>
          <span class="svcx-go">Power Hour <span class="arw">→</span></span>
        </a>
        <a class="svcx" href="/services/design-review">
          <div class="svcx-top"><h3>Design Review</h3><span class="svcx-price">from £200</span></div>
          <p>A half-day review of your design, concept or prototype, delivered as a written report of prioritised, actionable recommendations.</p>
          <span class="svcx-go">Design Review <span class="arw">→</span></span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CORE SERVICES -->
  <section class="band alt" id="core">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="sec-idx">Core services</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title">Standalone, fixed-scope services</h2>
      <p class="sec-intro">Each is a discrete service you can buy on its own, each suiting a different point on the path from idea to production, so you can start wherever your project is right now.</p>
      <div class="svcx-grid">
        <a class="svcx" href="/services/feasibility-study">
          <div class="svcx-top"><h3>Feasibility Study</h3><span class="svcx-price">from £650</span></div>
          <p>Validate an idea before you invest: whether it can be built, the routes to manufacture and their costs, and a clear go, no-go or go-with-changes recommendation.</p>
          <span class="svcx-go">Feasibility Study <span class="arw">→</span></span>
        </a>
        <a class="svcx" href="/services/concept-mvp-development">
          <div class="svcx-top"><h3>Concept &amp; MVP Development</h3><span class="svcx-tag">Founder favourite</span></div>
          <p>Turn an idea into an evaluated, buildable concept and a working MVP you can put in front of users, test and raise investment on.</p>
          <span class="svcx-go">Concept &amp; MVP <span class="arw">→</span></span>
        </a>
        <a class="svcx" href="/services/design-verification">
          <div class="svcx-top"><h3>Design Verification</h3></div>
          <p>Prove the design works, is safe and is compliant before you commit to tooling, through engineering analysis, simulation and structured testing.</p>
          <span class="svcx-go">Design Verification <span class="arw">→</span></span>
        </a>
        <a class="svcx" href="/services/manufacturing-preparation">
          <div class="svcx-top"><h3>Manufacturing Preparation</h3></div>
          <p>Get a proven design ready for efficient, repeatable volume manufacture: DFMA, detail production CAD, a drawing pack with GD&amp;T, and liaison with your factory.</p>
          <span class="svcx-go">Manufacturing Preparation <span class="arw">→</span></span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PRODUCT DEVELOPMENT -->
  <section class="band" id="full">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="sec-idx">The full journey</span>
      <a class="svcx svcx-flag" href="/services/product-development">
        <span class="svcx-flag-tag">Product Development</span>
        <h2>Idea to production, taken end to end</h2>
        <p>One experienced engineer owning the whole path, bringing in a trusted network of specialists as the product needs them. Delivered in scoped, gated phases, working one step at a time to reduce cost and uncertainty.</p>
        <span class="svcx-go">Explore Product Development <span class="arw">→</span></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONTRACT -->
  <section class="band alt">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="sec-idx">For teams</span>
      <a class="svcx svcx-wide" href="/services/contract-engineering">
        <div class="svcx-top"><h3>Contract Engineering</h3></div>
        <p>Specialist or extra design engineering capacity for a team that already knows the project scope. Mechanical, firmware-mechanical crossover, thermal and design for manufacture, on a day rate, retainer or fixed-price basis, remote, hybrid or on-site.</p>
        <span class="svcx-go">Contract Engineering <span class="arw">→</span></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHO I HELP -->
  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="sec-idx">Who I help</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title">What stage are you at?</h2>
      <p class="sec-intro">Taking the right first step is important. If you want to know more, check out these three short pages for the three kinds of people I work with most.</p>
      <div class="svcx-grid svcx-3">
        <a class="svcx" href="/for-founders">
          <div class="svcx-top"><h3>For founders</h3></div>
          <p>You have an idea and want to turn it into something real. If you want help from someone who has actually been through the product development process before, you're in the right place.</p>
          <span class="svcx-go">For founders <span class="arw">→</span></span>
        </a>
        <a class="svcx" href="/for-startups">
          <div class="svcx-top"><h3>For startups</h3></div>
          <p>You need engineering expertise without a full-time hire. If you need a fast-moving but structured push toward production, that's where I excel.</p>
          <span class="svcx-go">For startups <span class="arw">→</span></span>
        </a>
        <a class="svcx" href="/for-companies">
          <div class="svcx-top"><h3>For product teams</h3></div>
          <p>You need a specific, hard-to-source skill or extra senior capacity, from someone who has taken products to volume manufacture and proved they can solve hard engineering problems.</p>
          <span class="svcx-go">For product teams <span class="arw">→</span></span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="band alt" id="contact-cta">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="cta">
        <div class="inner">
          <span class="eyebrow">Not sure where to start?</span>
          <h2 style="margin-top:14px">Tell me where you are, I'll let you know if and how I can help</h2>
          <p>Book a free intro call and tell me about your product and where you've got to. I'll be honest about what a sensible first step looks like, whether that's a study, an MVP, or just a Power Hour.</p>
          <div class="row">
            <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/#contact">Book a free intro call <span class="arw">→</span></a>
            <span class="price-tag">Or start with a <b>£50 Power Hour</b></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
<style>
  .svcx-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:26px}
  .svcx-grid.svcx-3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
  @media(max-width:760px){.svcx-grid,.svcx-grid.svcx-3{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  .svcx{display:flex;flex-direction:column;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--surface);padding:24px 26px;text-decoration:none;transition:.15s}
  .svcx:hover{border-color:var(--ink-3);transform:translateY(-2px)}
  .svcx-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px}
  .svcx h3{font-size:1.2rem;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:var(--ink)}
  .svcx p{color:var(--ink-2);font-size:0.98rem;margin-top:10px;line-height:1.5;flex:1}
  .svcx-price{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--ember);flex:none}
  .svcx-tag{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ember);border:1px solid var(--ember);border-radius:20px;padding:2px 9px;flex:none}
  .svcx-go{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:18px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ember)}
  .svcx-wide{margin-top:26px}
  .svcx-flag{margin-top:26px;border-color:var(--ember);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .svcx-flag::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(120% 160% at 100% 0%,var(--ember-tint),transparent 55%);pointer-events:none}
  .svcx-flag>*{position:relative}
  .svcx-flag-tag{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ember)}
  .svcx-flag h2{font-size:clamp(1.4rem,2.6vw,1.9rem);letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-top:12px;color:var(--ink)}
  .svcx-flag p{max-width:72ch}
</style>
</Base>
